402202374429</dd>\n</dl>"},"2093457517380534549":{"a":"<p>TekShack in Linton</p>\n<p>You&#x27;ll see why it&#x27;s still on the shelf. Drive six hours in circles until you reach Hoosier then go south. Warning: Everything here is labeled Hoosier. 😂🤷🏻‍♂️</p>\n<p>Good thing it&#x27;s near the Olive Garden where people can still afford these things. <a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2093457517380534549\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ10gF3XcAEugbX.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ10gaRWEAAOXrf.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ10gvmXQAA15o-.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ10hAkXAAAmM8W.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2093457517380534549\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2093457517380534549</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2093446033783333210\">https://x.com/i/status/2093446033783333210</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2093457517380534549</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2093457517380534549\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-08-28T21:55:41.000Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>7</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>2093446033783333210</dd>\n</dl>"},"2093462952078660005":{"a":"<p>You have basically two groups of people<br>\nArguing because neither<br>\nHave Any Idea What the Other is Doing.</p>\n<p>Egypt is rebuilding Machina Vitae.</p>\n<p>You&#x27;re in the way trying to document debris.</p>\n<p>You don&#x27;t have time for them to wait but they won&#x27;t tell you why.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://t.co/XnqnFDYhBJ\">t.co</a></p>\n<p>You think the debris is precious. It is not. It&#x27;s in the way. The precious is below the debris.</p>\n<p>Restore the power and the debris reassembles into what was shattered. You think it&#x27;s sand. Computer chips are made of that same sand.</p>\n<p>Read the stories for once and believe people when they tell you who they are.<br>\nSincerely, Maya (Angelo)</p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/p79WtVYCDG8?enablejsapi=1\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p79WtVYCDG8\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>","m":"<h1>Post 2093462952078660005</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2093462952078660005\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-08-28T22:17:17.000Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>2093462952078660005</dd>\n</dl>"}}